###############################################################################
# Mouse Aim Flight - .gitignore for a Kerbal Space Program plugin mod
###############################################################################

## Build output
# Written by MSBuild beside the project and rebuilt on every compile.
bin/
obj/
*.pdb

## Compiled plugin
# The post-build step copies the assembly into GameData so a linked install can
# load it. Releases are built from source, so the copy in the tree is only ever
# a local build and never belongs in history.
GameData/MouseAimFlight/Plugins/*.dll

## Release archives
# Built by zipping GameData for a release. Regenerated on demand, so there is
# no reason to carry them in history where they would bloat every clone.
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
Release/
Releases/
build/

## KSP and Unity assemblies
# The plugin compiles against these from a local KSP install. They belong to
# Squad and Unity and may not be redistributed, so a copy made for convenience
# must never be committed.
Assembly-CSharp*.dll
KSPAssets.dll
UnityEngine*.dll
Unity.*.dll
Mono.*.dll
System*.dll
mscorlib.dll
netstandard.dll

## Game logs and runtime output, wherever they land
KSP.log
Player.log
output_log.txt
*.log
PluginData/

## IDE / editor cruft
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.DotSettings.user
*.sublime-workspace

## OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

###############################################################################
# Local-only working material. NOT for publication.
#
# Other mods' builds and sources, kept next to the repository to compile
# against or compare with. Other people's work under other people's terms; this
# mod ships none of it.
#
# Remove an entry only if you deliberately intend to publish it.
###############################################################################
external-files/
NOTES.md
